  ('pen-surcharge-eopt', 'penalty.surcharge', 'penalty', 'all', '{"standard":"0.25","micro_small":"0.10","willful":"0.50"}'::jsonb, '2024-01-22', null, 'NIRC Sec. 248, as amended by RA 11976 (EOPT); RR 6-2024', 'https://www.bir.gov.ph/', null, true, 'Confirm whether the willful (50%) surcharge is also reduced for micro/small taxpayers — modeled as NOT reduced.'),
